### Login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@rentflow.app",
  "password": "RentFlow@2026",
  "device": "Chrome on Windows"
}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create M-Pesa payment
POST http://localhost:4000/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": "unit_a12",
  "tenantId": "usr_tenant_1",
  "amount": 840,
  "method": "mpesa"
}

### Submit maintenance request
POST http://localhost:4000/api/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "prop_westlands",
  "unitId": "unit_a12",
  "title": "Kitchen sink leak",
  "priority": "high",
  "mediaUrls": ["/uploads/sink-leak.jpg"]
}
